    <tags>lithuania lithuanian name-days calendar cli vardadieniai</tags>
    <summary>Lithuanian name days on the command line: who celebrates today and tomorrow, and when a name is celebrated.</summary>
    <description>Command line tool for the Lithuanian name day calendar (vardadieniai).

- `vardadieniai` – today's and tomorrow's name days in Lithuania (Europe/Vilnius time)
- `vardadieniai 11-09` – who celebrates on a date
- `vardadieniai --vardas azuolas` – when a name is celebrated (diacritics optional)
- `vardadieniai --menuo 12` – the whole month

All 366 days are built in, no network access. The full calendar with greetings: https://dovanasuvardu.lt/vardadieniai/

Code MIT, data CC BY-SA 4.0 (Lithuanian Wikipedia).</description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/ello-lithuania/lietuviski-vardadieniai/releases</releaseNotes>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\**" target="tools" />
  </files>
</package>
